"At the time, we skipped over some details in this code. In [“The `match` "
"Control Flow Construct”](ch06-02-match.html#the-match-control-flow-"
"construct)<!-- ignore --> section in Chapter 6, we discussed that `match` "
"arms must all return the same type. So, for example, the following code "
"doesn’t work:"

