"   Compiling minigrep v0.1.0 (file:///projects/minigrep)\n"
"    Finished `dev` profile [unoptimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 0.0s\n"
"     Running `target/debug/minigrep monomorphization poem.txt`\n"
