#: src/ch09-02-recoverable-errors-with-result.md:185
#: src/ch09-02-recoverable-errors-with-result.md:221
#: src/ch09-02-recoverable-errors-with-result.md:252
#: src/ch09-02-recoverable-errors-with-result.md:304
#: src/ch09-02-recoverable-errors-with-result.md:394
