"// `first_word` works on slices of string literals, whether partial or\n"
"    // whole.\n"
msgstr ""
"//`first_word`处理字符串字面值的切片，无论是部分还是<br/>\n"
"//整体。<br/>\n"

#: src/ch04-03-slices.md:471
