"```console\n"
"$ cargo test\n"
"   Compiling guessing_game v0.1.0 (file:///projects/guessing_game)\n"
"    Finished `test` profile [unoptimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 0.66s\n"
"     Running unittests src/lib.rs (target/debug/deps/"
